  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Thread lamb cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "3. Brush lamb skewers with vegetable oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "4. Grill lamb skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until cooked to desired doneness.",
    "5. Meanwhile, heat Thai peanut sauce in a small saucepan over low heat.",
    "6. Grill or toast crispy fried shallots until crispy.",
    "7. Serve lamb skewers with Thai peanut sauce, crispy fried shallots, kissed pineapple, and Thai basil.",
    "8. Garnish with additional Thai basil leaves, if desired.",
    "9. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
